  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.1\n            - Extracted native interop codes into a dedicated native class\n            - Fixed ABI mismatch in C# P/Invoke by using UnmanagedType.I1 for Rust bool parameters\n            - Added OpenccConfig enum for conversion configuration\n            - Added Jieba CutForSearch/CutAll/Tag functions\n            - Added POS Tag in Jieba Keyword Extractions\n            - Update native to v0.7.4\n            - Added missing XML documentation comments for several public APIs.\n            - Improved IntelliSense descriptions for segmentation and tagging methods.",
